==English==
{{rfc}}

===Etymology===
Seems to have originated from a phase by [[w:Manute Bol|Manute Bol]], a player of Sudanese origin for the [[w:Golden State Warriors|Golden State Warriors]] basket ball team in California. Other players picked it up and started using it.

===Interjection===
{{en-intj|pos=[[my]] [[bad]]}} 

# {{colloquial}} My fault; [[mea culpa]].
#: ''Yes, I realize the humvee isn't supposed to be parked in the heirloom flowerbed. '''My bad'''.''
 
